    "title": "Wire Thieves Plunge Stockton Streets Into Foggy Darkness - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jennifer Martinez ,\n1 days ago Whole stretches of Stockton are going dark as thieves rip copper wiring out of streetlight vaults, according to city officials and frustrated neighbors. In recent days, work crews have been spotted scrambling to respond, draping tarps over exposed cables and pouring concrete into manholes in an effort to cut off easy access for the thieves. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 10",
